2026-04-05 13:17:13.739 | 507086 (507086) | DEBUG    | Model response tool call: {"tool_name": "exit_plan_mode", "args": {"plan": "# Robustness Refactoring Plan \u2014 Workspace Layout\n\nThis plan standardizes the structural foundation of the AI Builder, ensuring layout stability, smooth transitions, and visual alignment with the \"Intelligence Suite\" standard.\n\n## 1. BuilderLayout.tsx Hardening\n- **Dynamic Dimensions**: Implement CSS variables (`--workspace-h`, `--sidebar-w`) for more robust scaling.\n- **Smooth Transitions**: Wrap the main content area in `motion.main` from Framer Motion to ensure fluid structural shifts when sidebars are toggled.\n- **Hydration Guard**: Add a top-level check to ensure the layout remains stable during project initialization.\n\n## 2. BuilderCanvas.tsx Viewport Refinement\n- **Atmospheric Grid**: Standardize the 28px grid and synchronize it perfectly with the sidebar and header.\n- **Crop Marks**: Implement physical 'Safe Zone' crop marks in high-fidelity preview mode to match the `A4Page.tsx` physical layout.\n- **Spectral Overlay**: Add a subtle \"Neural Probing\" overlay triggered during high-latency RAG or generation operations.\n- **Focal Integrity**: Add `requestAnimationFrame` guards to the zoom and scroll handlers to prevent stuttering.\n\n## 3. BuilderSidebar.tsx & Containers\n- **Manifest Footer**: Implement the standardized \"Stable Manifest\" footer (`v2.4.0-STABLE`) inside the sidebar container.\n- **State Resilience**: Harden the `isCollapsed` logic to handle stale keys and ensure safe panel mapping.\n- **Typography Hardening**: Synchronize `SidebarContainer.tsx` and `SidebarSection.tsx` with the high-density technical labels (`text-[10px]`, `font-black`, `uppercase`).\n\n## 4. BuilderHeader.tsx Identity\n- **Active Sync**: Add a pulsing operational node next to the project name to signal real-time synchronization.\n- **Persistence Logic**: Wrap project rename triggers in optimistic rollback blocks to ensure state integrity.\n\n## Target Files\n- `src/modules/ai-content/adapters/components/builder/layout/BuilderLayout.tsx`\n- `src/modules/ai-content/adapters/components/builder/layout/BuilderCanvas.tsx`\n- `src/modules/ai-content/adapters/components/builder/layout/BuilderSidebar.tsx`\n- `src/modules/ai-content/adapters/components/builder/layout/BuilderHeader.tsx`\n- `src/modules/ai-content/adapters/components/builder/layout/SidebarContainer.tsx`\n- `src/modules/ai-content/adapters/components/builder/layout/SidebarSection.tsx`\n"}, "tool_call_id": "pyd_ai_a7ea37234a7744d18fbca4a05a3c6bb2", "id": null, "provider_name": "google-vertex", "provider_details": {"thought_signature": "ZTI0ODMwYTctNWNkNi00MmZlLTk5OGItZWU1MzllNzJiOWMz"}, "part_kind": "tool-call"}
